1
00:00:04,683 --> 00:00:05,767
<font color="white">他来了啊</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:43,221 --> 00:00:44,514
<font color="white">我不会让你逃掉的</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:48,143 --> 00:00:49,978
<font color="white">传送功能已被锁定</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:50,937 --> 00:00:52,939
<font color="white">我都忘了</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:53,648 --> 00:00:54,983
<font color="white">可恶啊</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:57,194 --> 00:00:58,653
<font color="white">有反应了？</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:08,705 --> 00:01:11,666
<font color="white">这是测试装甲</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:12,250 --> 00:01:16,421
{\an8}<font color="white">对啊 因为是测试装甲才能正常使用</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:16,505 --> 00:01:19,341
<font color="white">对了 那个混蛋</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:02:51,766 --> 00:02:53,018
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:02:55,562 --> 00:02:56,605
<font color="white">-不可能…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-怎么了？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:02:57,355 --> 00:03:00,150
<font color="white">测试装甲被传送出去了</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:03:00,650 --> 00:03:01,943
<font color="white">你说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:03:05,614 --> 00:03:06,990
<font color="white">他在哪里？</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:03:15,665 --> 00:03:18,877
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,462
<font color="white">井手先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:03:20,545 --> 00:03:23,089
<font color="white">你在做什么？立刻回来</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:03:25,926 --> 00:03:27,093
<font color="white">他被杀害了</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:03:29,179 --> 00:03:31,431
<font color="white">你刚才说了什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:03:31,514 --> 00:03:34,434
{\an8}<font color="white">我爸被杀了</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:35,518 --> 00:03:38,521
{\an8}<font color="white">早田被杀了？怎么可能</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:38,605 --> 00:03:42,359
{\an8}<font color="white">从刚才我就一直</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">试图与佐菲装甲取得联系</font></font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:42,442 --> 00:03:44,277
<font color="white">但是至今对方仍未响应</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:44,361 --> 00:03:49,074
{\an8}<font color="white">不过也可能是装甲故障</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">应该先确认事情真相…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:49,157 --> 00:03:51,243
<font color="white">现在没空扯那些</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:51,326 --> 00:03:53,203
<font color="white">对我爸痛下杀手的外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:53,286 --> 00:03:55,121
<font color="white">就在我眼前逃跑</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:55,205 --> 00:03:57,499
<font color="white">难道要叫我眼睁睁地看他溜走吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:57,582 --> 00:03:59,292
<font color="white">不对 不是这样</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:59,376 --> 00:04:01,253
{\an8}<font color="white">诸星先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:04:01,336 --> 00:04:03,546
<font color="white">我们不是叫你放他一马</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:04:04,547 --> 00:04:07,259
<font color="white">是要你什么都别做</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:04:07,342 --> 00:04:10,387
<font color="white">你这么做明显是违背命令</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:04:11,930 --> 00:04:13,974
{\an8}<font color="white">现在立刻给我回来</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:04:40,417 --> 00:04:43,962
<font color="white">真不愧是奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:48,216
<font color="white">你就是害死我爸的外星人吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:49,301 --> 00:04:52,679
<font color="white">那么说不太正确</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:54,347 --> 00:04:57,309
<font color="white">纯粹是因为他想拯救众人</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:57,392 --> 00:04:59,686
<font color="white">因而遭到波及罢了</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:05:00,770 --> 00:05:03,398
<font color="white">明明没人求他那么做</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:05:05,150 --> 00:05:09,446
<font color="white">你爸可真是爱管闲事啊</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:05:25,003 --> 00:05:28,340
{\an8}<font color="white">你开什么玩笑</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:05:50,236 --> 00:05:53,198
<font color="white">与奥特曼的通讯中断了</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:05:53,281 --> 00:05:55,992
<font color="white">意思是他开始交战了？</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:05:56,076 --> 00:05:58,703
<font color="white">那样一来就很难强制解除了</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:05:58,787 --> 00:06:00,997
<font color="white">不 他已经被锁定了</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:06:01,581 --> 00:06:02,665
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:06:03,917 --> 00:06:07,837
<font color="white">诸星、太郎 请你们尽快追上进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:06:09,380 --> 00:06:10,381
<font color="white">收到</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:06:11,341 --> 00:06:14,135
<font color="white">那小子老爱给人添麻烦</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,263
<font color="white">我先出去了</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:06:20,558 --> 00:06:21,893
<font color="white">你怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:06:21,976 --> 00:06:24,562
<font color="white">不 什么事也没有</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:06:25,897 --> 00:06:27,065
<font color="white">这样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:07:19,951 --> 00:07:21,286
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:07:39,679 --> 00:07:40,722
<font color="white">怎么回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:07:43,808 --> 00:07:46,352
<font color="white">-什么？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-他不是才刚引发事件吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:07:49,397 --> 00:07:51,733
<font color="white">小声点 被他听到就糟了</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:07:51,816 --> 00:07:53,234
<font color="white">好可怕啊</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:07:54,903 --> 00:07:56,654
<font color="white">看来大众</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:07:56,738 --> 00:08:00,408
<font color="white">并未如传闻般支持你啊</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:08:00,909 --> 00:08:02,535
<font color="white">你在说什么…</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:08:02,619 --> 00:08:03,828
<font color="white">住口</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:08:22,847 --> 00:08:24,349
<font color="white">给我站住</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:08:34,859 --> 00:08:37,195
<font color="white">那么奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:08:37,278 --> 00:08:39,447
<font color="white">我现在要给你出个题目</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:08:41,115 --> 00:08:46,704
<font color="white">对你抱持猜忌的那些大众</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:08:46,788 --> 00:08:49,916
<font color="white">若是身陷危机之中</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:08:49,999 --> 00:08:55,338
<font color="white">你仍然会去拯救他们吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:08:55,421 --> 00:08:59,676
<font color="white">还是会不顾他们的死活</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">继续来追我？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:09:01,302 --> 00:09:02,554
<font color="white">这是什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:09:04,430 --> 00:09:07,183
<font color="white">你就二选一吧</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:09:09,602 --> 00:09:10,895
<font color="white">你打算做什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:09:23,783 --> 00:09:25,326
<font color="white">住手啊</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:09:41,050 --> 00:09:43,177
<font color="white">果然是有其父必有其子</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:09:44,053 --> 00:09:49,350
<font color="white">这景象简直是重现了刚才的那幕啊</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:10:00,820 --> 00:10:02,822
<font color="white">侦测到两股高能量反应</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:10:02,905 --> 00:10:04,490
<font color="white">其中一个应该是源自奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:10:04,574 --> 00:10:07,285
<font color="white">他的能量值急剧增长</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:10:07,368 --> 00:10:09,078
<font color="white">限制器被擅自解除了</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:27,972
<font color="white">真意外啊</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:11:29,450 --> 00:11:30,701
<font color="white">那家伙呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:53,391
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:12:08,781 --> 00:12:09,699
<font color="white">奇怪</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:12:10,825 --> 00:12:14,996
<font color="white">可能遭受外星人攻击</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:12:15,079 --> 00:12:17,415
<font color="white">移动至室内避难</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:12:17,498 --> 00:12:21,586
<font color="white">并打开电视或收听广播</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:12:21,669 --> 00:12:23,296
<font color="white">这些是我…</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:12:34,140 --> 00:12:35,391
<font color="white">我怎么会做这种事？</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:12:39,729 --> 00:12:41,105
<font color="white">对了 那家伙跑去哪了？</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:12:41,189 --> 00:12:42,064
<font color="white">不准动</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:12:45,234 --> 00:12:46,277
<font color="white">诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:12:47,528 --> 00:12:49,989
<font color="white">-你是来帮我…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不是</font></font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,202
{\an8}<font color="white">我要拘捕你</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:12:57,497 --> 00:12:59,373
<font color="white">你愿意听我解释吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:12:59,457 --> 00:13:00,791
<font color="white">不用听也知道</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:13:01,709 --> 00:13:03,544
<font color="white">现在的你过于危险</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:13:04,587 --> 00:13:06,380
<font color="white">你目睹父亲被干掉</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:13:07,173 --> 00:13:09,842
<font color="white">因此导致情绪失控 原因仅止于此</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:13:16,641 --> 00:13:18,809
<font color="white">请别那么轻描淡写地带过</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:13:22,813 --> 00:13:26,192
<font color="white">你懂父亲被杀的我有何心情吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:13:26,275 --> 00:13:27,568
<font color="white">我懂</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:13:30,988 --> 00:13:32,073
<font color="white">太郎先生</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:13:33,074 --> 00:13:34,909
<font color="white">我也曾经体会过</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:13:36,118 --> 00:13:39,789
<font color="white">那是一种异于悲伤跟愤怒</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:13:39,872 --> 00:13:43,292
<font color="white">几乎无法用言语确切形容的情感</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:13:46,337 --> 00:13:47,922
<font color="white">我对你这么说过对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:13:49,549 --> 00:13:52,718
<font color="white">但我们一定能揭开真相</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:13:52,802 --> 00:13:54,095
<font color="white">我相信办得到</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:13:54,762 --> 00:13:57,640
<font color="white">你也要相信自己</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:13:59,725 --> 00:14:03,521
<font color="white">你敢坚信自己</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">现在的行为不是错的吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:14:09,193 --> 00:14:10,570
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:14:13,990 --> 00:14:15,616
<font color="white">只能选择这么做</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:14:16,492 --> 00:14:18,160
<font color="white">那么拜托你不要抵抗</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:14:18,703 --> 00:14:22,248
<font color="white">然后让我们相信你吧</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:14:25,334 --> 00:14:27,003
<font color="white">凌晨12点38分</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:14:28,170 --> 00:14:30,298
<font color="white">成功拘捕奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:14:38,180 --> 00:14:39,348
<font color="white">知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:14:56,991 --> 00:14:58,784
<font color="white">晚了一步吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:15:00,494 --> 00:15:01,787
<font color="white">是阿达多吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:15:04,874 --> 00:15:07,209
<font color="white">好 我知道</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:15:08,127 --> 00:15:12,506
<font color="white">星团评议会也将有所行动是吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:15:18,262 --> 00:15:20,389
<font color="white">要用上那个男人了吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:15:36,072 --> 00:15:41,243
{\an8}<font color="white">已厘清昨晚接连发生</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">由奥特曼引发的爆破事件全貌</font></font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:15:43,579 --> 00:15:46,040
{\an8}<font color="white">所幸无人罹难</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:15:46,123 --> 00:15:48,000
{\an8}<font color="white">不过伤者众多</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:15:48,084 --> 00:15:50,086
{\an8}<font color="white">并造成大量建筑损毁</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:15:50,169 --> 00:15:55,007
{\an8}<font color="white">致力于复兴一年前惨案的相关人士</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">为这起事件感到忿忿不平</font></font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:15:56,258 --> 00:16:01,806
<font color="white">另外在发生淡谷区事件</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">三小时后的晚间11点40分</font></font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:16:01,889 --> 00:16:03,683
<font color="white">距离事故现场五公里远的地区</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:16:03,766 --> 00:16:06,477
<font color="white">别栋大楼失火</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:09,605
<font color="white">有许多民众表示</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">在此也有目击奥特曼</font></font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:16:10,189 --> 00:16:12,817
<font color="white">目前警方正在调查关联性</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:16:13,985 --> 00:16:15,361
{\an8}<font color="white">大谷教授</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:16:15,444 --> 00:16:17,905
{\an8}<font color="white">这一连串的事件除了外星人的攻击外</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:16:17,989 --> 00:16:22,034
{\an8}<font color="white">能确信奥特曼也有助长灾情恶化</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:16:22,118 --> 00:16:24,245
{\an8}<font color="white">请问您的看法如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:16:24,328 --> 00:16:27,039
<font color="white">这个嘛 我从以前</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:16:27,123 --> 00:16:31,919
<font color="white">就不断指出奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">与社会关系产生的问题</font></font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:16:32,003 --> 00:16:33,879
<font color="white">他们之所以能够活动</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:16:33,963 --> 00:16:38,426
<font color="white">是搭上大众追求英雄的顺风车</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:16:39,343 --> 00:16:41,220
<font color="white">而过度依赖奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:16:41,303 --> 00:16:45,641
<font color="white">这类过度强大的特定对象</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:16:45,725 --> 00:16:50,062
<font color="white">有极高可能会酿成这次的灾害</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:16:51,105 --> 00:16:54,275
<font color="white">我认为现在正是社会大众…</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:16:54,358 --> 00:16:56,694
<font color="white">奥特曼究竟是怎么了呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:16:57,778 --> 00:16:59,780
<font color="white">在那时候…</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:17:00,364 --> 00:17:05,411
<font color="white">出现的虽然身形小</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">但我也把他当成真的奥特曼</font></font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:17:06,245 --> 00:17:09,790
<font color="white">话说刚才那个某某教授也没说错</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:17:09,874 --> 00:17:13,127
<font color="white">奥特曼确实造成了不小的损害</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:17:13,961 --> 00:17:15,087
<font color="white">天晓得</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:17:15,171 --> 00:17:17,381
<font color="white">你不在意奥特曼的事情吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:17:17,465 --> 00:17:19,717
<font color="white">那不关我的事</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:21,844
<font color="white">你少在那边发表观众感言</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:17:21,927 --> 00:17:23,596
<font color="white">差不多该准备前往现场了</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:27,850
<font color="white">前往现场？不就是有人闯空门吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:17:27,933 --> 00:17:31,312
<font color="white">我们被彻底排除在</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">与外星人相关的案件外了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:17:31,979 --> 00:17:34,065
<font color="white">远藤先生 你应该也难以接受吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:17:34,148 --> 00:17:36,692
<font color="white">案件就是案件 我们走吧</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:17:36,776 --> 00:17:37,902
<font color="white">钱我放桌上了</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:17:37,985 --> 00:17:39,153
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:17:39,236 --> 00:17:41,489
<font color="white">别走 等等我啦</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:17:41,572 --> 00:17:42,698
<font color="white">感谢招待</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:17:42,782 --> 00:17:44,575
<font color="white">谢谢惠顾</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:17:47,453 --> 00:17:51,874
<font color="white">然而另一方面正是因为忽略了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">他们拥有强大力量的危险性</font></font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:17:51,957 --> 00:17:55,044
<font color="white">才会引来报应 让昨晚的事发生…</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:18:00,591 --> 00:18:01,967
<font color="white">玲奈</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:18:02,718 --> 00:18:04,220
<font color="white">什么事啦？</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:18:04,303 --> 00:18:06,764
<font color="white">你有受邀出演电视节目 要接吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:18:06,847 --> 00:18:09,934
<font color="white">我现在没有心情谈工作的事</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:18:10,017 --> 00:18:12,019
<font color="white">是喔 这样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:18:12,103 --> 00:18:16,023
<font color="white">也是啦 要跟批评</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">奥特曼的教授公开讨论</font></font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:18:16,107 --> 00:18:18,484
<font color="white">现在这时间点还是别接为妙</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:18:18,567 --> 00:18:19,819
{\an8}<font color="white">你说的那是…</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:23,114
<font color="white">你以前是以奥特曼的粉丝为卖点</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:18:23,948 --> 00:18:26,992
<font color="white">但实际上发生不少事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">已经变得没那么喜欢了吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:18:27,660 --> 00:18:28,786
<font color="white">我要接</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:18:29,662 --> 00:18:31,038
<font color="white">你说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:18:31,122 --> 00:18:32,665
<font color="white">我愿意接受挑战</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:18:32,748 --> 00:18:35,751
<font color="white">是喔 这样啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:18:36,544 --> 00:18:39,713
<font color="white">应该是晚上7点过后吧</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:18:39,797 --> 00:18:41,465
<font color="white">我听到爆炸声</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:18:41,549 --> 00:18:44,802
<font color="white">就从床上跳起来</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">担心得冲出门看看情况</font></font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:18:44,885 --> 00:18:47,429
<font color="white">结果在那期间家里有东西被偷了</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:18:49,223 --> 00:18:51,350
<font color="white">请问你当时出门多久？</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:18:52,351 --> 00:18:54,770
<font color="white">大概20到30分钟吧</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:18:54,854 --> 00:18:56,814
<font color="white">听说其他人的家也遭小偷</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:18:56,897 --> 00:18:59,733
<font color="white">这栋公寓的住户</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">几乎都是窃盗案受害者</font></font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:18:59,817 --> 00:19:02,945
<font color="white">虽然有请警察尽快赶来</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:19:03,028 --> 00:19:04,989
<font color="white">但没有找到任何线索</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:19:07,074 --> 00:19:08,325
<font color="white">还有注意到其他事情吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:19:12,663 --> 00:19:14,748
<font color="white">正是如此</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:19:15,416 --> 00:19:17,960
<font color="white">我做管理员那么久</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:19:18,043 --> 00:19:20,087
<font color="white">还是第一次碰到这种事</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:19:22,256 --> 00:19:26,552
<font color="white">另外不知道是不是那起爆炸案害的</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:19:26,635 --> 00:19:29,221
<font color="white">我们这里明明有四台摄像头</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:19:29,305 --> 00:19:32,308
<font color="white">却完全没拍到画面</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:19:32,391 --> 00:19:34,351
<font color="white">你说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:19:41,942 --> 00:19:43,194
<font color="white">-辛苦了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好</font></font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:19:45,070 --> 00:19:48,115
<font color="white">犯案痕迹被抹除</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:19:48,199 --> 00:19:50,492
<font color="white">还同时出现多位被害者</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:19:53,537 --> 00:19:55,789
<font color="white">果然是职业小偷干的吧</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:19:55,873 --> 00:19:58,667
<font color="white">事情没那么单纯</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:19:58,751 --> 00:20:00,377
<font color="white">可是…</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:20:00,461 --> 00:20:01,712
<font color="white">不然呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:20:01,795 --> 00:20:05,966
<font color="white">数起职业小偷的偷窃案件</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">和奥特曼引发的事件</font></font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:20:06,050 --> 00:20:08,093
<font color="white">这两者的时间点</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">只是碰巧重叠在一起吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:20:08,177 --> 00:20:11,222
<font color="white">那样一想 确实是很巧没错啦</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:20:12,514 --> 00:20:17,561
<font color="white">犯人预先得知会发生那起事件？</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:20:19,271 --> 00:20:21,190
<font color="white">不 怎么可能</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:20:23,025 --> 00:20:24,944
<font color="white">话说回来 远藤先生</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:20:25,027 --> 00:20:28,614
<font color="white">只要一牵扯到奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你的脑袋顿时就会特别灵光呢</font></font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:20:28,697 --> 00:20:31,200
<font color="white">才没有 我只是觉得…</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:20:32,534 --> 00:20:35,412
<font color="white">凡事都以奥特曼失控来结案</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:20:36,622 --> 00:20:38,749
<font color="white">实在叫我难以接受</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:20:39,583 --> 00:20:43,545
<font color="white">那就是刑警的直觉吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:20:43,629 --> 00:20:45,214
<font color="white">-天啊</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-你是什么人？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:20:46,507 --> 00:20:47,841
<font color="white">我吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:20:49,134 --> 00:20:51,887
<font color="white">我是百慕拉</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:20:51,971 --> 00:20:53,681
<font color="white">和你一样</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:20:53,764 --> 00:20:57,393
<font color="white">是追寻这起事件真相的人</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:20:57,476 --> 00:21:00,229
<font color="white">这是怎么一回事啊 远藤先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:03,107
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:21:05,442 --> 00:21:07,778
<font color="white">一直在关注你</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:21:18,247 --> 00:21:19,540
<font color="white">什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:21:20,708 --> 00:21:22,960
<font color="white">当必要之时到来</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:21:23,043 --> 00:21:25,129
<font color="white">我将助你一臂之力</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:21:28,757 --> 00:21:30,884
<font color="white">那家伙到底是什么来头？</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:21:30,968 --> 00:21:34,388
<font color="white">他也很小只 不会是奥特曼吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:21:50,738 --> 00:21:53,198
<font color="white">久候多时了</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:21:53,824 --> 00:21:57,703
<font color="white">你这家伙并不是阿达多</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:21:58,829 --> 00:22:00,247
<font color="white">你是什么人？</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:22:07,921 --> 00:22:09,715
<font color="white">就是这样的人</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:22:11,300 --> 00:22:12,760
<font color="white">不好意思啦</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:24:05,038 --> 00:24:08,125
<font color="white">字幕翻译：梁雪莹</font><font color="white"></font>

